    "reason": "Issue #57 follow-up. The 54 instrument fields are labelled as codebook text (Qualtrics export with item ids, response codes and entities as written), not as the participant-visible layout; the text itself is unchanged. SOURCE.json uses the title printed on the PDF ('Sample and Setting') and notes the journal title for the DOI. The two typed-passage stimuli of the Zhong et al. replication cite the pictures they are transcribed from: the stimulus pictures already in the package, byte-identical to the pictures in the Slate 2 codebook (sha256 recorded). The pictures have no text layer, so a text search cannot confirm them.",
